      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "The new deleteMany filter uses `OR` with `{ retryCount: { gt: 1 } }` as a standalone branch, so any WorkflowReminder with retryCount > 1 is deleted regardless of method or scheduledDate. Before this change, only past-due SMS reminders were removed. Because the retry increment paths update `retryCount` for failures, this now turns the cron into a broad destructive cleanup that can remove non-SMS reminders and still-pending reminders after enough failures.",
